<h2>Carry one idea forward</h2>
<p>You do not need to redesign your entire life to make it more intentional. Pick one small decision you make often and give it a little more care. Then see where that attention takes you.</p>
<ol><li>Choose a practice you want to keep.</li><li>Try it for seven ordinary days.</li><li>Write down what you learned, not just what you achieved.</li></ol>
<p><em>Good work is not always loud. Sometimes it is simply the next thing, done with care.</em></p>
